check eq get Certkey 0 0 57
note Leaf policy without signatures: the SAN mutant parses but must fail the identity check.
tchain
check ctparse 0 7 1017 58
check ctleaf 59
check tmut 911 110 60
check not ctleaf 61
ret int get Fails 0
end
